# Upstream OpenCode experiment outputs and oversized test fixtures.
# They are not referenced by any build target Metamorfus uses, and they
# are already excluded from the container image (see
# packages/opencode-src/.dockerignore). The upstream test suite that
# consumed the fixtures would need to fetch them separately.
